{"sentences":[{"id":"s_work_clt_218_1","chapterId":"ch_work_clt_218","textTraditional":"一、五年，春，王正月，辛亥，朔，日有食之。","sentenceOrder":1},{"id":"s_work_clt_218_2","chapterId":"ch_work_clt_218","textTraditional":"二、夏，歸粟於蔡。","sentenceOrder":2},{"id":"s_work_clt_218_3","chapterId":"ch_work_clt_218","textTraditional":"諸侯無粟，諸侯相歸粟，正也。孰歸之？諸侯也。不言歸之者，專辭也，義邇也。","sentenceOrder":3},{"id":"s_work_clt_218_4","chapterId":"ch_work_clt_218","textTraditional":"三、於越入吳。","sentenceOrder":4},{"id":"s_work_clt_218_5","chapterId":"ch_work_clt_218","textTraditional":"四、六月，丙申，季孫意如卒。","sentenceOrder":5},{"id":"s_work_clt_218_6","chapterId":"ch_work_clt_218","textTraditional":"五、秋，七月，壬子，叔孫不敢卒。","sentenceOrder":6},{"id":"s_work_clt_218_7","chapterId":"ch_work_clt_218","textTraditional":"六、冬，晉士鞅帥師圍鮮虞。","sentenceOrder":7}],"overrides":{}}